                                "sense_id": "08c2823b-b113-3047-9fc7-63e1f2c90ed8",
                                "text": "[…] mingled into one beautiful and continuous peal of that earthly harmony which Heaven has given us as a forehearing of those sublimer harmonies that, in its everlasting bowers, take the imprisoned soul, \"and lap it in elysium.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8bd1f2e-541e-42f3-8456-64fa707afa87",
                                "sense_id": "08c2823b-b113-3047-9fc7-63e1f2c90ed8",
                                "text": "In that flash of time as his fingers had touched the handle of the table-spoon, he had foreseen John's wild rush to the doors, he had foreheard John's agitated cry of \"Thieves! Police! Burglars!\""
                            },
