                                "sense_id": "08c2823b-b113-3047-9fc7-63e1f2c90ed8",
                                "text": "Holiday labor at the island today: being his guest is a hazardous responsibility: I foresee a swell and forelean to a spumy pitch and forehear the scuff of a badly perched sack of cement as it slips into the racing bay, and my New York imagination […]"
